cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or report, cite it as below."
title: "Fish Oil and Omega-3 Supplements: An Independent Evidence Review and Product Database"
abstract: >-
  A structured review of EPA and DHA supplementation covering biology,
  formulation and bioavailability, cardiovascular and metabolic outcomes,
  cognition, mental health, joints, pregnancy, safety, oxidation, contaminants,
  certification, sourcing and sustainability. Includes a 20-product cost database
  normalised to cost per gram of labelled EPA+DHA, 70 graded evidence rows, 35
  adjudicated claims, and a validation pipeline.
